    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-regular-verseYuanZhenANELEGYI",
      "translationRaw": "Oyoungest，best-loveddaughterofXie，Whounluckilymarriedthispennilessscholar，Youpatchedmyclothesfromyourownwickerbasket，AndIcoaxedoffyourhairpinsofgold，tobuywinewith；Fordinnerwehadtopickwildherbs--Andtousedrylocust-leavesforourkindling。。。。Todaytheyarepayingmeahundredthousand--AndallthatIcanbringtoyouisatemplesacrifice。",
